```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start[Inbound request / Envelope]
    Sig{Signature valid?<br/>design boundary}
    Size{Within size limit?<br/>Pydantic validation}
    Idem{Idempotency key seen?}
    Extract[Run extraction]
    LLM{Output valid &<br/>confidence >= 0.85?}
    Injection{Injection or<br/>contradiction detected?}
    Policy[Evaluate deterministic policy]
    Eligibility{Decision eligible<br/>for approval?}
    Approve{Human approval command<br/>signature, expiry & nonce valid?}
    Send[Dispatch message]
    AuditLog{Audit sink write<br/>successful?}
    Done[Terminal Success]

    Reject[Reject + log error]
    Duplicate[Return prior decision]
    Quarantine[Quarantine / Archive]
    FailClosed[Reject: fail-closed]
    Halt[Halt processing / DLQ]

    Start --> Sig
    Sig -->|no| Reject
    Sig -->|yes| Size
    Size -->|no: validation error| Reject
    Size -->|yes| Idem
    Idem -->|yes: duplicate| Duplicate
    Idem -->|no| Extract
    Extract --> LLM
    LLM -->|no: schema failure or low confidence| Quarantine
    LLM -->|yes| Injection
    Injection -->|yes: injection or contradiction| Quarantine
    Injection -->|clean| Policy
    Policy -->|requires approval| Eligibility
    Policy -->|spam / archive| Quarantine
    Eligibility -->|no: spam or quarantine| FailClosed
    Eligibility -->|yes| Approve
    Approve -->|no: expired, replayed, or bad signature| FailClosed
    Approve -->|yes| Send
    Send --> AuditLog
    AuditLog -->|no: write failure| Halt
    AuditLog -->|yes| Done

    classDef normal fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#475569,color:#111827;
    classDef decision fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#111827;
    classDef failure fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#c2410c,color:#111827;
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#047857,color:#111827;

    class Start,Extract,Policy,Send normal;
    class Sig,Size,Idem,LLM,Injection,Eligibility,Approve,AuditLog decision;
    class Reject,Duplicate,Quarantine,FailClosed,Halt failure;
    class Done terminal;
```
